    "long_instructions": "# Sea Ice Change\r\n\r\nThe program includes `sea_ice.csv`.\r\n\r\n## Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Load the dataset and print the `head()`.\r\n2. Group the data by `Decade` and use aggregations to answer:\r\n\r\n   **How has the average sea ice extent changed from the 1980s to the 2010s?**\r\n\r\n3. Print your answer. For example:\r\n\r\n   *Between the 1980s and 2010s, average sea ice extent changed by ___ million square kilometers.*\r\n\r\n::: details [Need help?]\r\n\r\nUse AI Tutor to:\r\n\r\n- View documentation for a pandas function\r\n- Explain unfamiliar code or an error message\r\n\r\nThen use what you learn to write your own code.\r\n\r\n:::",
